# Kept intentionally: source (meridian/, scripts/), docs (*.md), demo/,
# deliverables (results/*.html, *.jpg, *.png, *.json, *.csv), data/fred_*.csv

# Exception: the audited volatility benchmark's saved forecasts are kept so every number in
# results/benchmark_vol.json can be re-scored in seconds (scripts/score_vol_benchmark.py)
!results/benchmark_vol_predictions.parquet
!results/benchmark_vol_predictions_ablation.parquet
!results/benchmark_tail_predictions.parquet

